{"name":"Goldbricker","hex":"#c5a049","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"goldbricker","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A lazy person; an idler.","A cheater; a swindler."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/goldbricker"}],"entries":[{"title":"Goldbricking","blocks":[{"text":"Goldbricking is the practice of doing less work than one is able to, while maintaining the appearance of working. The term originates from the confidence trick of applying a gold coating to a brick of worthless metal—while workers may appear industrious or productive on the surface, in reality they are less valuable."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/99/An_American_soldier_or_airman_waiting_to_see_a_doctor..._Wellcome_L0074420.jpg/330px-An_American_soldier_or_airman_waiting_to_see_a_doctor..._Wellcome_L0074420.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goldbricking","wikidata":"Q5579041"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Sèvres - Magot - Pajou, buste de Madame du Barry 08","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ca/S%C3%A8vres_-_Magot_-_Pajou%2C_buste_de_Madame_du_Barry_08.jpg/500px-S%C3%A8vres_-_Magot_-_Pajou%2C_buste_de_Madame_du_Barry_08.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:S%C3%A8vres_-_Magot_-_Pajou,_buste_de_Madame_du_Barry_08.jpg","share":0.185625},{"title":"Gordon Brown (2008)","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Gordon_Brown_%282008%29.jpg/500px-Gordon_Brown_%282008%29.jpg","ratio":0.7823681298413869,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gordon_Brown_(2008).jpg","share":0.11125},{"title":"Alumnae Hall, Brown University","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6f/Alumnae_Hall%2C_Brown_University.jpg/500px-Alumnae_Hall%2C_Brown_University.jpg","ratio":1.7751479289940828,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Al